 3. Sample test

Enter these values when running the program:

| PID | Arrival Time | Burst Time | Priority |
| --- | ------------ | ---------- | -------- |
| 1   | 0            | 5          | 2        |
| 2   | 1            | 3          | 1        |
| 3   | 2            | 1          | 3        |

Set the Round Robin time quantum to `2`.

Expected metrics:

| Metric                  | FCFS | Round Robin |
| ----------------------- | ---- | ----------- |
| Average waiting time    | 3.33 | 2.67        |
| Average turnaround time | 6.33 | 5.33        |

The execution order is `P1 → P2 → P3` for FCFS. Round Robin switches between processes after each time quantum, allowing other ready processes to execute.
